# Pairs with SagaBatchOnOneCopy. Reproduces #4369 as it stood before #4376: the
# pre-decision check re-binds to the resized copy although the bound copy
# mirrors into it, leaving the whole batch's prepares on T under a decision
# taken on R.
MODULE: SagaBatchOnOneCopyPreDecisionRebindIgnoresMirror
TARGET: SagaBatchOnOneCopy
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the pre-decision check re-binds although the bound copy mirrors, stranding the batch on the old copy
PERTURBS: SagaRebindBeforeDecision

--- FIND
    /\ prepped = Keys
    /\ alias # bound
    /\ ~BoundMirrors
    /\ bound' = alias
--- REPLACE
    /\ prepped = Keys
    /\ alias # bound
\* MUTATION: re-bind whether or not the bound copy mirrors.
    /\ bound' = alias
--- END